{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Gut Eater</strong> \u2013 A psychological horror experience where your only mission is to take care of a cat... unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 A mysterious package. Inside, a creature that stares at you, tests you\u2026 and waits. It\u2019s no ordinary pet \u2014 it\u2019s a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf56 Feed him. Entertain him. Touch him. Survive. But the more you play, the deeper he slips into your mind\u2026 and your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\ude28 An oppressive game: he knows when you hesitate, he knows when you're afraid.<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83e\udde0 Horror that breaks the screen: what if your nightmare became real?<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f A constant sense of unease: are you playing\u2026 or being played?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udeaa You\u2019re locked in with him. And he\u2019s hungry. \ud83e\udd2e\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83e\udec0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632570?t=1744289682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/8d041b9d2758333150549d6cf0fc39d29ec51831/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744289682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/735588df8f28c51d42bc7892c3769408f2362ea0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744289682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/735588df8f28c51d42bc7892c3769408f2362ea0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744289682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Gut Eater</strong> \u2013 A psychological horror experience where your only mission is to take care of a cat... unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83